用二十一萬一千四百二十功，以擅興造免官。後公卿並為之言曰：「張闓興陂溉田，可謂益國，而反被黜，使臣下難復為善。」帝感悟，乃下詔曰：「丹陽侯闓昔以勞役部人免官，雖從吏議，猶未掩其忠節之志也。倉廩國之大本，宜得其才，今以闓為大司農。」闓陳黜免始爾，不宜便居九列。疏奏，不許，然後就職。帝晏駕，以闓為大匠卿，營建平陵，事畢，遷尚書。蘇峻之役，闓與王導俱入宮侍衛。峻使闓持節權督東軍。王導潛與闓謀，密宣太后詔于三吳，令速起義軍。陶侃等至，假闓節，行征虜將軍，與振威將軍陶回共督丹陽義軍。闓到晉陵，使內史劉耽盡以一部穀，並遣吳郡度支運四部穀，以給車騎將軍郗鑒。又與吳郡內史蔡謨、前吳興內史虞潭、會稽內史王舒等招集義兵，以討峻。峻平，以尚書加散騎常侍，賜爵宜陽伯。遷廷尉，以疾解職，拜金紫光祿大夫。尋卒，時年六十四。子混嗣。闓箋表文議傳於世。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0113","start":113,"end":114,"surface":"闓","kind":"person","person_id":"076_097_db5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0130","start":130,"end":131,"surface":"闓","kind":"person","person_id":"076_097_db5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"葛洪","kind":"person","person_id":"e0x_rxd_hiy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0188","start":188,"end":190,"surface":"張闓","kind":"person","person_id":"076_097_db5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0214","start":214,"end":215,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-zhangkai:line131:m0227","start":227,"end":228,"surface":"闓","kind":"person","person_id":"076_097_db5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-07